<title>PHILIPPINES: Guoco Holdings Q1 net 250.39 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Guoco Holdings Q1 net 250.39 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guoco Holdings Philippines Inc said on Tuesday its net income for the first quarter of its fiscal year starting July amounted to 250.39 million pesos.</p>
<p>Guoco Holdings, a unit of Hong Kong's Guoco Group Ltd, said it generated revenues amounting to 286.93 million pesos from July to September 1996.</p>
</text>
